@startuml
title UML classes — Explore programs
class PublicContentHandler { +HandleAsync(address): PublicContentDto? }
class PublicContentDto <<record>> { Programs Tracks Mentorship Impact }
class PublicTrackDto <<record>> { Name Description? Modules }
class PublicModuleDto <<record>> { Title Description? Badge? }
PublicContentHandler ..> PublicContentDto
PublicContentDto *-- PublicTrackDto
PublicTrackDto *-- PublicModuleDto
@enduml
